:" purely because of the identity gate. ","type":"text"},{"code":"padVerdict","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"isolates the PAD decision so the spoof metric is read off one field,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"independent of enrolment:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PADVerdict\/genuine"},{"text":" — the per-frame fused verdict held genuine for one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"uninterrupted second. Final for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presentation: a later denial does not regrade it, exactly as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"recorded clip is graded. With the liveness CNN on the second rests on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"CNN runs: in a presentation opened by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"beginPresentation()"},{"text":" it starts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only once a CNN run has completed after it, and a frame the CNN was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offered and did not score (no crop, a model failure) breaks it — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"next one starts on the next CNN run.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/PADVerdict\/spoof"},{"text":" — no held second yet, and some frame of the presentation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"was denied (flat depth and\/or a CNN spoof verdict at the current","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"operating point).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documenta